Space Sim / Space Sim Successor Game and Assets License
======================================================

Copyright (c) 2026 pink-kitsune-420. All Rights Reserved.
SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-Project

1. Scope and ownership

This proprietary license covers the Space Sim (Space Sim Classic) and
Space Sim Successor (Space Sim Tiles Demo) games and their game-specific
source code, scripts, configurations, missions, ship definitions, universes,
levels, 3D models, textures, audio, lore, UI, artwork and branding. It also
covers the bundled game packages (.spacegame), universe packages
(.spaceuniverse), universes/ content, and generated game assets derived
from those proprietary sources, including copies in browser, offline,
desktop, server and Android distributions. The root LICENSE identifies
the proprietary game implementation files outside the game directories.
These materials are the exclusive proprietary property of pink-kitsune-420.

2. Permission for non-commercial use, mods and forks

You may view, copy, compile, run, modify and create derivative works from
these materials for non-commercial purposes. This includes playing the
games, creating mods, maintaining public source-code forks, making
modified builds, and creating custom missions, ships, universes, code
and assets.

You may publish, redistribute and publicly host the original or modified
materials, in whole or in part, free of charge for non-commercial use.
This includes complete game builds, repackaged applications, standalone
forks, browser-hosted copies, multiplayer servers and free app-store
releases. Recipients do not need to obtain a separate copy of the original
game. These permissions apply to source, compiled and packaged forms.

3. Conditions for sharing

Keep applicable copyright and attribution notices and include this license
with any proprietary game materials you distribute. Clearly identify
unofficial distributions, mods and forks as unofficial, and describe any
changes you make. You may use the game name to identify the original game
or describe compatibility, but may not imply official status or endorsement.

Recipients receive the same permissions under this license to use,
modify, host and redistribute included proprietary game materials. You
may not relicense those materials or impose terms that remove these
permissions. You retain ownership of your original contributions; this
license does not transfer ownership of the original game materials.

4. No sale or commercial monetization

Without prior written permission from the copyright holder, you may NOT
sell, resell, rent, charge for access to, or otherwise commercially exploit
the games, their proprietary materials, or mods, forks and other works
containing or derived from those materials. This includes selling the
original or a modified game on the Apple App Store, Google Play, another
storefront or your own website, and monetizing game copies or access
through advertising, subscriptions or in-app purchases. Offering a free
download does not permit these forms of monetization. These restrictions
apply to source, compiled and packaged forms, including hosted services.

5. Engine and third-party exclusions

The Spacelab Engine, public APIs, reusable libraries, generic host runners
and shared tools remain subject to their MIT license, as identified in the
root LICENSE and LICENSE-ENGINE.txt. Using them does not grant rights to
the proprietary game materials. Third-party materials retain their own
licenses and notices. This license does not change the ownership or
licenses of independently authored games, universes or assets.

